---
description: Git and Unreal binary asset safety
alwaysApply: true
---

- Do not mass-rename/move `.uasset` or `.umap` files.
- Before changing shared binary assets, confirm ownership/LFS lock status.
- Never commit Binaries, DerivedDataCache, Intermediate, Saved, or IDE caches.
- Avoid unrelated binary changes in code-focused tasks.
